WHY CC0 AND NOT A SHARE-ALIKE LICENCE
A benchmark that others cannot build on, correct, extend or sell is not a
benchmark; it is a marketing asset with a licence file. The point of publishing
these labels is that a competitor can run their own system against them and
publish a number that contradicts ours.

WHAT THE LABELS ARE NOT
The citations name public enforcement actions and are believed accurate as at
17 August 2026. They are not legal advice, they are not a statement that any
entity is currently under suspicion, and a `negative` label means only that no
documented matter was found at labelling time — not that none exists. Entities
move between classes as enforcement is opened, resolved, appealed or reversed.
Corrections are welcome and are the reason this file is in the public domain.

NO THIRD-PARTY DATA IS REDISTRIBUTED HERE
This repository contains no article text, no encyclopaedia content and no
vendor's dataset. The harness asks a screening system about a NAME. The
optional baseline adapter fetches Wikipedia at run time; that text is
